Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛格先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的时辰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:20.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想困在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to get stuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.51,0:00:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成鬼魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn into some ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我在做什么  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm doing, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在想你能帮助那俩小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're thinking you can help those boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你遇见几个头脑正常的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how many sprits you meet in their right mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么打算  是走是留\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be -- stay or go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心鲍比也许一直跟着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm concerned that Bobby might be haunting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已试过和鲍比联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already tried contacting Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不叫上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他在的话  我就会告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he was there, I'd have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.85,0:00:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他火葬了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We burned him, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那把剑从屋子另一边飞到我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade was across the room, and then it was in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我的酒自己没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beer drank itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  那页书奇迹般的出现在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That page magically appeared on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.87,0:00:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比的书自己掉了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's book fell down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到小卡那人的号码自动掉了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and out popped the number of the guy who found cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  不可能  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it couldn't be! - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那是我们一厢情愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使普通人  也能到处看到死去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regular people -- they see ones they lost everywhere, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  那叫鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, freakin' ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者只是因为他们太想念那些人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they just miss them a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:05.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那是鲍比  他会让我们知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was Bobby, he would let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  开吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算整个世界天翻地覆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though the world is going to crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有样东西总是靠得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's one thing that I can always count on --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:33.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意儿的口味始终如一\N{\fnArial\fs30}these things tasting the same 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们伟大的祖国每家小店都一个样\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every drive-through in every state in our great nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是意外  你最近怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice surprise. How you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还活着  所以算是不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm still kicking. So, good, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说了鲍比的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard about Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.47,0:02:03.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这儿还有他一些旧书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got some of his old books.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:08.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe you'd want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure. Where you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玻底加湾  乌巢旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bodega Bay. Crow's nest inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你还在工作  -必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You working? - Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.81,0:02:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们离这近吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys anywhere nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-挺近的  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Near enough. - Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在码头餐馆碰面怎样  一起吃午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we meet at the pier front restaurant -- lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一点见  -好  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 1:00? - Yeah. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不该来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第19集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克·罗曼又要资助一个考古挖掘项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Roman is funding another archaeological dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这货比狗仔队还能挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy moves more dirt than "The drudge report."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.73,0:04:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有提到他要挖什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anything on what he's digging for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要看到了肯定会先说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think I would have led with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮一般不迟到  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie's not usually this late, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:36.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有强迫症  我给她打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's totally compulsive. I'll try her cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她和鲍比有过一腿  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, you know she and Bobby had a thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烽火战地情神马的  海明威格调的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a foxhole thing -- very Hemingway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和她也搞过一次"海明威"\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and I kind of went Hemingway this one time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时有发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你也有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是很久前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it was a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正好在查同一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ended up on the same case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她压力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't...have a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来战地情略多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of foxholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:31.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬阴魂已散的鬼魂们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's to ghosts that aren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:40.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听上去挺失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound kind of disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我很想再见他一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, even though I wish we could see him again
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.47,0:05:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean that we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.43,0:05:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是被放鸽子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we being stood up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  希望只是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, let's hope that's all this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:06.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是没通吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接进了语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight to voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她来玻底加湾干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing on Bodega Bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有活儿干  她没详说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's working some kind of job. She didn't really say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得买酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get a refill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你暂时把酒瓶收起来比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just pack it away for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只会让你想起他  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it does is remind us of him, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我有想过  但是  时候未到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought about that, but, uh...not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去安妮的酒店房间看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go check out Annie's hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久前这里发生过不少失踪悬案\N{\fnArial\fs30}These go back years -- disappearances never solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:41.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几十年前突然停止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stop a few decades back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而最近又再次开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then pick up again just recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失踪的都是青少年\N{\fnArial\fs30}All teenagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮似乎发现一个他们失踪前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Annie found a spot a lot of them liked to poke around
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,常去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}just before they went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:53.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  凡·奈斯老宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Old Van Ness house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各种好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, cheery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察去那儿搜查过  总是空手而归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the police combed the place. They always come up dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:07:00.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  警方的办事能力  我们都懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, local law. Always on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是凡·奈斯家族在1862年修建的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, built in 1862 by the Van Ness family...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才动了动窗帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just made that curtain shimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就不能看看该看的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you look in the right place at the right time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.89,0:07:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好几年前就挂出来卖  没人接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up for sale a few years back. No takers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是太毛骨悚然了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably 'cause it creeps their queso.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的  累死爹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls, this is exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年就一直在那儿  围着栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just been sitting there, boarded up, for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是几个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess a couple months back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人把它列入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone put it on one of those, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"美国最恐怖鬼屋"的名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}"most haunted houses in america" lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  正是开始有青少年失踪的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- that's when the teenagers started going missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们干活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's get rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:30.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们干活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we get rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.01,0:07:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝儿  我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的同类啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫鲍比  我是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bobby, and I'm a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给咱稍微介绍一下这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoping for a little ghost orientation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Je m'appelle Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真"热闹"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的反应很强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a whole lot of something going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你昨晚做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you did last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:08.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我对此是严令禁止\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know it was forbidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家里不允许发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't brook that sort of thing in my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.35,0:09:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下不为例  德克斯特  否则别怪我不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it again, Dexter, or there will be consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.43,0:09:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一通电话就是打给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The call to me was the last one she made.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.53,0:09:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她到底去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:23.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:29.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到处找你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.81,0:09:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm a doornail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏消息就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你看得见我  你也死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can see me, you are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡  鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead. Ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.65,0:09:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都不希望这三个词出现在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three words you never want to use in a sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉就像嗑了药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I was drugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大概一个月后才知道我还在人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure it was a month before I even knew I was still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你算不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-棒极了  -这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Terrific. - So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也把死神甩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you duck your reaper, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  没有  压根没看见死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. I never even saw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从死神手里逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran away from your reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你还在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.47,0:10:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你这稀里糊涂的老疯子  -嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You stupid, crazy old -- - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你以前挺喜欢我这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember a time when you liked how crazy I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.31,0:10:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为身不由己死掉的正常鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a regular ghost with no choice in the matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我鄙视你\N{\fnArial\fs30}screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有事情没做完  跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I got unfinished business here, Same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我没做完的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's my unfinished business right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:46.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了  这俩人脑袋不太灵光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're not the brightest bulbs on the string.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我进来时  发现他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came in, they were roadkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后有个大家伙朝我冲了过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this big guy charges me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就没点乐子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a fun aspect to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且到目前为止  我完全没搞懂规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so far, I can't crack the code on any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见过恶作剧鬼拿砸钢琴当热身运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've seen poltergeists bench a piano as a warm-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就想帮帮俩孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to help the boys out once
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是把桌上的书弄到了地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}by knocking a book off the table
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果足足晕厥了两个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}and blacked out for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  萨姆和迪恩还不知道你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Sam and Dean don't even know you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是够呛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮  我把那些剪报发到你邮箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, annie, I'm e-mailing you those news clippings
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方到处都是红的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're redlining all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做最坏打算吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assume the worst?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  怨魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Vengeful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准有一大堆呢  杀孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe lots of them. Killing kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧  没有血迹  什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around. No blood. No anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定没有尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly no bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果魔鬼在这儿开联欢会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if evil is partying here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的清洁队可真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's got a hell of a cleanup crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是早几天打的电话  -听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- From earlier this week. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,释放我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,释放我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是哪里打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你见过这种手机号码吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever seen a phone number look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错啊  酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂可不是最喜欢跟人打交道的物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostsosin't the most sociable type to come down the pike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过既然他能做到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he can do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好优雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Novices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.61,0:12:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都犯一样的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all make the Same mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你一定很熟络了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose you know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.72,0:13:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都练了八十年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've been at it 80 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚死不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, uh, fresh meat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不知道发生什么事了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even sure what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我头部中枪  什么都没感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got shot right in the melon, never felt a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1932年4月17日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stabbed brutally,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这个吧台被人残忍地捅死\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here at this bar, April 17, 1932.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who done ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:26.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这里怎么会有这么多死人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come there's so many dead folk in this place, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know anything about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:30.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们不应该谈论这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're not supposed to talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我朋友很八卦  你叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, my friend is a little nosy, mister...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克雷恩  哈斯克·克雷恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crane-- Haskel Crane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.15,0:13:40.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈斯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haskel...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:41.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩是新手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are novices,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, could you do me a solid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教教我怎么搬动这张椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and show me how to move that chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是张破椅子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one stupid chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一步一步慢慢来  美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby steps, gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.11,0:13:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太焦虑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angsting at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道沮丧会带给你什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what getting frustrated will get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要移动东西有两个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got two ways to move things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用的方法  显然也是你必须做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did-- which you obviously must--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}is calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  我们要用禅意来移动东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying we should move crap with the power of zen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  放松心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you to let go of all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静地告诉那东西要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calmly tell the thing what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.65,0:14:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选项二是什么  你说过有两种方法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's option 2? You said there were two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你勃然大怒  火冒三丈的时候也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you could use explosive anger and pure, red-hot rage,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但怒气是不能伪装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's impossible to manufacture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:15:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像恶作剧鬼  心怀怨念之魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like poltergeists-- vengeful spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也怨念啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am vengeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我不会暴怒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't have red-hot rage?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你就是鬼魂中的败类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're a sad excuse for one of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于你的失败我一点都不惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm unsurprised that you're failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要我帮忙随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my help or don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过如果你还想移动一个小跳蚤\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to move a flea,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就乖乖听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先声明  我讨厌那个鬼片\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record, I hated that swayze flick--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人鬼还言情啥的烂片\N{\fnArial\fs30}romantic bullcrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in cold hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总有一日也会变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.13,0:15:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以不同的速度退化\N{\fnArial\fs30}We deteriorate at different rates--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些早一点  有些晚一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}some sooner, some later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}And eventually all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灰飞烟灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing left at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂的老年痴呆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost Alzheimer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是越来越讨厌做鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm liking this less.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:01.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找遍了这地方的每个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is every square inch of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.51,0:16:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有尸体  没有残肢  没有安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bodies, no pieces of bodies-- no Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷声大雨点小啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole lot of sizzle and no steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没消息也算是好消息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe no news is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思就是  也许她只是不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning maybe she's just not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许她没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she's still okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你的直觉怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and what does your gut say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是去看看她的调查里还有些什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just see if there's anything else in her research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.72,0:16:22.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.95,0:16:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你以为我没试过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, don't you think I've tried that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我嗓子都吼哑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouted myself hoarse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你知道那些想和我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now you know how all the ghosts
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说话的鬼魂是什么感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who have ever tried to talk to us feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只能等着他们发现你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to wait until they find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我都不知道我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't even know where I'm at.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把每间房都翻五遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've searched every room five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪他们就这样走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder they're walking away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我自我感觉良好  还是她真在打量我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it me, or am I being checked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  汉子  她是在打量我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stud. I'm being checked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.53,0:16:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那天看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you here the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the kind of work you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在做着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm still doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然在另一个次元里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, other-dimensionally speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attagirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是给我打电话的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one on my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.42,0:17:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里的时候  我可以那样联络你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were here, I was able to call out to you that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂声音传递\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, spectral voice transference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  鬼魂的小把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Ghost juju.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:28.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说"释放我"是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... W-what exactly did you mean when you said, "Free me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.35,0:17:31.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维多利亚  是什么束缚了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria, free you from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮的情报是哪来的  我们知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd Annie get her intel? Do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破酒瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玻底加湾遗产协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bodega Bay Heritage Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该干的活儿在房子里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the action's back in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:52.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这栋宅子的历史一直追溯到十九世纪中期\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house dates back to the mid-19th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.55,0:17:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈尔斯·凡·奈斯淘金发了迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miles Van Ness made his fortune in the gold rush,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:17:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后在玻底加湾安了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}eventually settling his family in Bodega Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这宅子里发生过什么奇怪的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything...unusual ever happen in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个世纪的时间长河中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the course of a century,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一栋宅子总会发生些事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}things are going to happen in a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"告诉它要做什么"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tell it what to do".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,部分当地人发誓那里真的有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some locals swear it's haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-动  -每个村里都有几个二逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move. - Every village has its idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想听真正的猛料\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only want the real scoop, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惠特曼·凡·奈斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whitman Van Ness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家中的男孩也是继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son and heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,英俊  迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handsome, charming,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一生却是个彻头彻尾的悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}dogged by tragedy all his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.45,0:18:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,败光了家族财产  最后连宅子也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost the family fortune, then the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:31.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里变成了妓院\N{\fnArial\fs30}It became a bordello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到四十岁死去  他一直都孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lived in isolation till his death at age 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.39,0:18:35.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还在那里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个大块头是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the, uh, the bruiser there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.35,0:18:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德克斯特·欧康纳德是个囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dexter O'Connell. A convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个极暴力的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}An extremely violent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.09,0:18:44.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡·奈斯先生是个思想进步的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Van Ness was socially progressive
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对他心生怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took pity on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个看护员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worked as grounds keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德克斯特被判在惠特曼新婚前夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dexter was convicted for murdering Whitman's fiance
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谋杀了他的未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the eve of their wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这可怜人人生中的又一起悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another calamitous event in the poor man's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这宅子这周可真是火啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house is popular this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.19,0:19:05.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前几天有个女士来问了许多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lady came by the other day asking all sorts of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-三十多岁  红发  很漂亮  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, 30's, red hair, good-looking? - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你们的建议跟对她的一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave her the same advice I'll give to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.33,0:19:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离那鬼地方远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里非常的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's extremely unsafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了被判谋杀惠特曼的未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, besides Whitman's fiance,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德克斯特·欧康纳德还被判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dexter O'Connell was also convicted
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谋杀了数个那家妓院的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}of killing a bunch of hookers who worked at the brothel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在被绞死前逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He escaped before they could hang him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但后来他又回到了那栋宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then he returned to the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里被人用枪打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he was found shot to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么跑掉后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he escape
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又跑回去  被人抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then go right back to the house where he got arrested?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有好多事不知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Add that to a list of things I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一步打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意等到天荒地老  等你们俩搞清状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be getting old waiting on you two to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀得了狼人  修得好斑马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can kill werewolves, fix a Pinto,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:04.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烤得好玉米面包\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bake cornbread.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:07.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是做不到禅真见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be damned if I can't get zen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.83,0:20:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把这段视频放上来是为了警告...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're posting this video as a warning about...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能是纪念...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or possibly a memorial to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.51,0:20:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的朋友黛比·特伦和达利·斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friends Debbie Tellen and Dudley Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们最后出现的地方是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last known whereabouts...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡·奈斯大宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Van Ness house...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正警察也不管这事儿...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the cops haven't done crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这或许是他们爱情故事终结的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what may be the final moments of their love story.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们俩差不多从八年级就在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been together since like eighth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他俩进宅子后给我们发了短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They entered this house and texted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我这是你写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you wrote that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(安妮被困在大宅里)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.22,0:20:57.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们走进了宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came into the house...well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那又会是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.56,0:21:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说谁在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(安妮被困在大宅里)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(鲍比)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:34.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.13,0:21:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们穿过了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}They walked through...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}these halls...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找爱的小巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeking a grotto of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.61,0:21:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.29,0:21:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直都在说服自己他不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole time, we've been trying to talk ourselves out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就在...他怎么会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been-- What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-老兄  -咱们没时间扯这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude. - We don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.95,0:22:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧滚回那栋宅子去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your asses back to that house!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回那栋宅子去  赶紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get back to that house, stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.89,0:22:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.26,0:22:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dexter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经严令禁止了  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expressly forbid you! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.83,0:22:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德克斯特  你想把他们吓跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dexter, you tried to warn them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的鬼已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have enough of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:22:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还只是孩子  惠特曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just children, Whitman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不能坐视不理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't watch this happen all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.47,0:23:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:43.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维多利亚  拿上摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Victoria. Grab the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.51,0:23:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不掺合惠特曼的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't meddle in Whitman's affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.57,0:23:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打住  真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. Let's get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你向我发出了求救信号  现在我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me the S.O.S., and now I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:23:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  还是搭把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在他也能伤害你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now he can get you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.23,0:24:00.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么伤害我  我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me how? I'm already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.17,0:24:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你能告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you want to help me understand
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.51,0:24:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底把德克斯特怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}exactly what did he do to Dexter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.55,0:24:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惩罚了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punished him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.87,0:24:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要警告这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was trying to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.39,0:24:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也曾试着警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to warn you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.97,0:24:14.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把他吸干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drained him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸干  什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drained? What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他这么强大的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he's so strong
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.02,0:24:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你该躲着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why you should stay out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.72,0:24:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是他的食物  再就是恶心的玩物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're merely food to him -- food and perverse entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.39,0:24:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那之后发生了什么  就是烟消云散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when he does that, what happens? Just...poof?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.37,0:24:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.66,0:24:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了  我还以为惠特曼是个可怜人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I thought that Whitman was some poor guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.26,0:24:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是德克斯特杀了他的未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dexter killed his fiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.67,0:24:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  惠特曼嫁祸给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Whitman framed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.95,0:24:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是惠特曼杀了所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whitman killed all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.22,0:24:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里做妓院时  我在这儿做青楼女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this house was a brothel, I worked here as a fancy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.85,0:24:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他割了我的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slit my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-"青楼女子"  你是个妓女  -积积口德\N{\fnArial\fs30}-"Fancy lady"? A hooker? -Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.51,0:24:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在即使我们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, even in death,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.90,0:24:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每俘获一个灵魂  他的力量又强大一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}every soul he traps here makes him stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.40,0:24:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样  他把尸体藏在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, where does he keep the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.22,0:24:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.37,0:24:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维多利亚  你可在这里呆了很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria, you've been here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:25:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会傻到跟踪他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't follow him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.65,0:25:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  我们会干掉这个人渣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we are going to pull the plug on this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.73,0:25:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在去把那该死的录像机捡起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now grab the damn camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:13.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.94,0:25:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.41,0:25:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前彻底搜过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We combed the crap out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.45,0:25:49.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果安妮真的困在里面  我们却没找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Annie's in there and we didn't find her...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.02,0:25:50.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那肯定是因为有东西不想让我们找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 'cause something didn't want us to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.92,0:25:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了  明知宅有鬼  偏往里面闯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. Well, let's walk right into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我来搜楼上  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, I'll check upstairs. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.27,0:26:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  臭小子  暂且别过  -安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, boys. I'm leaving the pack. - Annie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.25,0:26:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我是迪恩  萨姆也在  -安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Dean! And Sam! - Annie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.25,0:26:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点不奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.77,0:26:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  快下楼来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, get back down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.16,0:26:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.00,0:26:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有鬼在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slimer?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -瞧瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.55,0:26:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们爱情故事终结的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The final moments of their love story.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.73,0:26:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们俩差不多从八年级就在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been together since like eighth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.90,0:26:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他俩进宅子后给我们发了短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They entered this house and texted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最讨厌这些独立电影  都是虚把式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hate these indie films. Nothing ever happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.28,0:27:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们走进了宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.30,0:27:03.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们穿过了...这些走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They walked through these halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.41,0:27:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  暂停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Pause it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.20,0:27:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向前倒一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frame back a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.63,0:27:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.04,0:27:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的确在这里  处境还不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here, and not in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.65,0:27:13.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他们点时间反应一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.85,0:27:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死之后他俩迟钝多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got a little slower since I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.28,0:27:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.25,0:27:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得想个法子让他们知道我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to let them know that I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.13,0:27:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来做  我俩办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to do it. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.57,0:27:25.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-安妮  -这太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Annie?  - It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.34,0:27:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两人能帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.28,0:27:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要知道我们就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just need to know that we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.63,0:27:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别害怕  我是维多利亚  维多利亚·陶德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I'm Victoria -- Victoria Dodd.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪里冒出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.93,0:27:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.64,0:27:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾是个青楼女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a fancy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.03,0:27:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妓女吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hooker?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.21,0:27:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, is Annie here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.57,0:27:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看不到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.17,0:27:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你没踩在她身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not standing on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.66,0:28:01.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你就直说了吧  -我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to just tell them? - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.80,0:28:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们那个时代  谈话的礼仪是很重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my day, we believed in polite conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.83,0:28:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮的处境非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie's in terrible danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.89,0:28:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁在威胁你们  -惠特曼·凡·奈斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- From? - Whitman van Ness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.09,0:28:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.03,0:28:13.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说他俩很有一手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said they were good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.68,0:28:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在消化这个消息  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm just processing, okay, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了  你也已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead. You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.78,0:28:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫"处境危险"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "terrible danger."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.36,0:28:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惠特曼控制着宅子里的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whitman has great power over all of us in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.70,0:28:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他杀了安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.82,0:28:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说你们能释放我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says you can free us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  你们必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you must --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.43,0:28:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.93,0:28:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想她说的是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say she was telling the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.11,0:28:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为刚刚她的鬼魂都被灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering that she just... got ghost-killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁干的  惠特曼·凡·奈斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? Whitman van Ness?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.71,0:28:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们知道要去谁的枯骨上撒盐  焚烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know whose bones to salt and burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.72,0:28:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.45,0:29:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.91,0:29:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没把酒瓶放在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't stashed that flask here,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.66,0:29:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就能呆在萨姆和迪恩身边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd still be glued to Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.71,0:29:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聪明反被聪明误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.01,0:29:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真有自知之明  -混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually was. - Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.37,0:29:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们的唯一优势就是惠特曼那混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured our one ace was that bastard Whitman
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.01,0:29:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也无法离开这栋宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't leave the house either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.23,0:29:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可能就像你和酒瓶的联系一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have pulled a number like you and the flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.26,0:29:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定把什么东西放在小伙子们身上  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably planted something on the boys. 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.19,0:29:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好极了  -听我说  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Terrific. - Hey, listen, sweetie --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:42.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以一整天都自怨自艾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could beat yourself up all day about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.42,0:29:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也可以利用惠特曼不在的良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we could take advantage of the fact that Whitman's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:47.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干我们应该干的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}do what we're supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.84,0:29:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.67,0:29:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来吗  罗伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming, Robert?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.68,0:30:01.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把别的地方都搜过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we searched everywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.91,0:30:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说  惠特曼对这个房间严防死守\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, Whitman guards his room like Fort Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.82,0:30:19.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知  鬼魂可不会怕冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I checked, ghosts didn't get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.99,0:30:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  那是维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.39,0:30:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他杀死她的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is how he took her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.39,0:30:28.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他从哪里取出了她的尸体呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where did he get her corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.19,0:30:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说他把那两个男孩的尸体拖走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you said he dragged those two dead kids away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.08,0:30:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,运到哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd he take them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.31,0:30:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我不敢冒险跟踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know. I couldn't risk following him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.49,0:30:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过这栋宅子除了做过妓院外\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did you say this place was,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.10,0:30:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用来干过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}other than a whorehouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.73,0:30:40.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干过好多事情呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.05,0:30:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做过公寓  寄宿学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a boarding house, a school...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非法酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A speakeasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.09,0:30:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到非法酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, thing about speakeasies --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.49,0:30:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定得藏很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a lot to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.57,0:31:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是很有一手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.80,0:31:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这差不多就能说明问题了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this pretty much tells the story, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.46,0:31:51.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  我和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you and me --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.85,0:31:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们烧过那么多尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We burned our fair share of bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.81,0:31:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送一群鬼魂上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}sent a lot of ghosts packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.66,0:32:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当自己是被烧的那个  感觉有点不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little different when you're on the receiving end.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.89,0:32:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.71,0:32:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都去哪了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think happens to 'em --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.67,0:32:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进天堂  下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven, hell, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the above?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.31,0:32:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.73,0:32:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可能  就这样消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...gone, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.53,0:32:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I think, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.23,0:32:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.44,0:32:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要一场猎人的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a hunter's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.27,0:32:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别惊讶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.00,0:32:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那比现在可好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better than this --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.23,0:32:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,困在这栋宅子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuck to this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.54,0:32:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,介乎于存在与不存在之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}somewhere between existing and not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.32,0:32:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.14,0:32:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经准备好安息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ready for some peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.05,0:32:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着也没有太大意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't much of a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.97,0:32:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这行很孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was lonely, what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.78,0:32:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那是我自己选择的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the life I had is the one I picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.73,0:33:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你还有那俩孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you had the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.53,0:33:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我就只有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I had was work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.35,0:33:06.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这也没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.38,0:33:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我的还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I ain't done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.59,0:33:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但我结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine, but I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.73,0:33:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在比我强壮  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger than I am now, Bobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.03,0:33:15.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你要帮我了却这个心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you got to do this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.76,0:33:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去的是  镇边上的墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Here we go -- cemetery, edge of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.20,0:33:26.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡·奈斯家族在那儿有一个陵墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Van Ness family has its own mausoleum.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.16,0:33:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就放把火让那混蛋消失吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we light up the bastard and finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.42,0:33:36.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢开  迟早能到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. We'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.73,0:33:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.96,0:33:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么他会跟我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's he with us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.91,0:33:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.95,0:34:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有什么东西在我们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be something on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.59,0:34:15.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了吗  甩掉他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that do it? Did that get rid of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.72,0:34:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我有不详的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I got a bad idea
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.62,0:34:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚把他送回老家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just snapped him back to his favorite house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.63,0:34:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮还待在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where Annie's a sitting duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.01,0:34:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上找到骸骨  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find those bones. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.67,0:34:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始点火吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's build up the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.95,0:34:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少可以让一些可怜的灵魂得以安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can put some of these poor bastards to rest, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.93,0:34:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始火葬吧  时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's get to cremating. We ain't got all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.85,0:35:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢我房间的风景吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the view from my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.74,0:35:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算减少这里的人口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planning to thin out the population?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.45,0:35:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就这样回报我的招待吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how you repay my hospitality?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.05,0:35:37.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不愿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I will not be taken!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.80,0:36:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昏迷了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long was I out?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.75,0:36:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A while.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.62,0:36:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.12,0:36:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.26,0:36:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.43,0:36:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.11,0:36:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.98,0:36:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是蛮不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, basically, swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.68,0:36:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.85,0:36:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.71,0:36:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.45,0:36:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看的到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.17,0:36:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盯着人看不礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staring, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.97,0:36:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  安妮也在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie's here, too, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.44,0:36:55.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Annie. H-hi, Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.30,0:36:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.08,0:37:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说你俩长残了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says you both look uglier than she remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.56,0:37:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你怎么会待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, h-how'd you stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.47,0:37:08.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.21,0:37:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck on that, swayze.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.38,0:37:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得你老是不理我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you never answered me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.51,0:37:24.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试着联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried calling you --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.52,0:37:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩碟仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, talking board,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.81,0:37:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做了那么多  但一直是我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the works -- but I was always alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.19,0:37:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而迪恩总是把那东西放在他口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean always had that thing in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.65,0:37:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以电磁波总是时有时无\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why the EMF only went off half the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.49,0:37:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还以为是自己疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we were going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.29,0:37:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那究竟发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-so, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.02,0:37:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是困住了  还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get stuck or -- or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.70,0:37:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.13,0:37:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-鲍比  -我要帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby. - I need to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.63,0:37:50.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也不能让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if it means you have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.21,0:37:53.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}be this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.91,0:37:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着本就不易  死后不需安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, life wasn't comfy. Why should death be?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.05,0:37:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.62,0:38:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮和我找到所有尸体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie and I found all the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.84,0:38:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来让他们安息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put 'em to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.46,0:38:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让酒瓶子掉火里面去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep my damn flask away from the fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.49,0:38:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们来不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会想念她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.62,0:38:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我也是  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me too. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.65,0:38:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟她的交情可不一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you didn't know her like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.16,0:38:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,致安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.11,0:38:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她得到了自己想要的猎人葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got the hunter's funeral she wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.46,0:38:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟当初我们为你办的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like the one we thought we gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.55,0:38:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.27,0:38:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么想的  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.07,0:39:01.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在本可在天堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be in heaven right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.34,0:39:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在乔和埃伦的酒馆喝啤酒  而不是困在\N{\fnArial\fs30}drinking beer at Harvelle's, not -- not stuck --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.12,0:39:05.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你们困在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuck here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.16,0:39:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还要活儿要干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.89,0:39:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得这很重要  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought that was kind of important, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.56,0:39:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这是不对的  你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not right. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.88,0:39:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你都是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.36,0:39:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么想的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.59,0:39:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.33,0:39:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该做的我们都做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did what we should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.04,0:39:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.11,0:39:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们还有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, do you think it's possible we could --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.46,0:39:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许跟他就这么好好相处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know -- make it all work somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.08,0:39:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.82,0:39:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻所未闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.07,0:40:03.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what I do know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.03,0:40:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不该是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't the natural order of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.62,0:40:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世间万物都该有终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is supposed to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.28,0:40:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他应该...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he was supposed --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.34,0:40:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.37,0:40:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样能有好结果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds this ends well?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.76,0:40:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
